# Stakeholder Analysis

| Stakeholder | Role | Main interest | Influence | Interest | Engagement approach |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Retail customer | Primary user | Fast, simple, secure account opening | Medium | High | User testing of wireframes and prototype |
| Branch consultant | Current process operator | Keep a role; less admin | Medium | High | Workshops; involve as digital-assisted-onboarding champions |
| Compliance / FICA analyst | Regulatory control | Accurate verification, audit trail | High | High | Co-design rules for referral and review queue |
| Head of Retail Banking | Business sponsor | Growth in new accounts, lower cost per account | High | High | Monthly steering committee; KPI reporting |
| Product Owner | Backlog owner | Deliver value each sprint | High | High | Daily collaboration; backlog refinement |
| Development team | Builders | Clear, testable requirements | Medium | High | Refinement sessions; acceptance criteria review |
| Information Security / Risk | Control owner | Fraud prevention, data protection | High | Medium | Early security review; threat modelling |
| Core banking / IT operations | System owner | Stable integrations | High | Medium | API contract workshops |
| Information Regulator / FIC (external) | Regulators | POPIA and FICA compliance | High | Low | Via compliance team |
| Identity verification vendor | Third-party service | Integration, volumes | Low | Medium | Vendor SLA and API documentation |

## Power / interest grid

- **Manage closely (high power, high interest):** Head of Retail, Product Owner, Compliance, Security
- **Keep satisfied (high power, lower interest):** Regulators, Core banking / IT operations
- **Keep informed (lower power, high interest):** Customers, Branch consultants, Development team
- **Monitor:** Identity vendor

## Key needs captured

- **Customer:** "I don't want to take time off work to go to a branch."
- **Branch consultant:** "I spend most of my time re-typing forms instead of helping customers."
- **Compliance analyst:** "I need a complete audit trail and a clear reason for every referral."
- **Head of Retail:** "I need to see how many accounts are opened and where customers drop off."
